<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The drawer holds what the bottom bar does not.

  Dashboard, Assets, Tickets and Network Scan are one tap away at the bottom
  of every screen; listing them here as well made the drawer look like the
  whole app and buried the things that are only reachable from it. What is
  left is exactly the set with nowhere else to live.
-->
